| rmvpeb.sbt 1;1 - remove page-ending blank lines
| This SCRUB table is often useful before running BRAIDE, when formatted
| braille file contains blank lines before a formfeed, which can confuse
| BRAIDE about how many lines per page are in the file.  It should not
| be used unless BRAIDE's "preserve" option will be used, because it can
| otherwise alter the apparent vertical centering of a page.
| Eliminate 2-14 blank lines before formfeed, when \r\n is used for newline
